        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Would the active or passive give readers a more consistent and appropriate point of view? The writer of this next passage reports the end of World War II in Europe from the point of view of the Allies. To do so, she uses active verbs (in green) to make the Allies a consistent sequence of subjects:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                117,
                772,
                220
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    220.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    220.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ By early 1945,  $ \\underline{\\text{the Allies}} $ had essentially defeated Germany; all that remained was a bloody climax.  $ \\underline{\\text{American, French, British, and Russian forces}} $ had  $ \\underline{\\text{breached}} $ its borders and were  $ \\underline{\\text{bombing}} $ it around the clock. But  $ \\underline{\\text{they}} $ had not yet so devastated Germany as to destroy its ability to resist.",
            "block_bbox": [
                102,
                229,
                742,
                326
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    102.0,
                    229.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    229.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    326.0
                ],
                [
                    102.0,
                    326.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Had she wanted to explain history from the German point of view, she would have used passive verbs (in green) to make Germany the subject/character:",
            "block_bbox": [
                103,
