        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ By early 1945,  $ \\underline{\\text{Germany}} $ had essentially been defeated; all that remained was a bloody climax.  $ \\underline{\\text{Its borders}} $ had been breached, and  $ \\underline{\\text{it}} $ was being bombed around the clock.  $ \\underline{\\text{It}} $ had not been so devastated, however, that  $ \\underline{\\text{it}} $ could not resist.",
